    "Keep a write index `w`, starting at 0. Scan with a read index; whenever the value is non-zero, put it at position `w` and advance `w`. Afterwards, fill positions `w` to the end with zeroes.",
    "Parallel example: to remove every space from a list of characters in place, copy each non-space character forward to a write position, then cut off the tail."
